## Type Definitions

### Common Types

```typescript
// Location types
type Location = {
  type: 'physical' | 'remote';
  address?: string;
  coordinates?: [number, number];
  radius?: number;
};

// Currency types - matches actual project implementation
type Currency = 'USD' | 'BTC' | 'L-BTC' | 'LN' | 'USDt' | 'RBTC' | 'tRBTC';

// Status types - matches actual TaskStatusEnum implementation
type TaskStatus = 'OPEN' | 'BID_ACCEPTED' | 'ESCROW_FUNDED' | 'IN_PROGRESS' | 'RESCOPED' | 'RESCOPE_ACCEPTED' | 'COMPLETED' | 'CANCELLED' | 'REFUNDED' | 'DISPUTED' | 'DISPUTE_PROPOSAL';
type BidStatus = 'PENDING' | 'ACCEPTED' | 'REJECTED' | 'WITHDRAWN' | 'COUNTERED';
type TransactionStatus = 'pending' | 'completed' | 'failed' | 'cancelled';

// Contract status types - matches actual contract implementation
type ContractStatus = 'active' | 'completed' | 'disputed' | 'resolved' | 'cancelled';

// Payment types - matches actual Breez SDK implementation
type PaymentMethod = 'liquidAddress' | 'bolt11Invoice' | 'bitcoinAddress' | 'bolt12Offer';
type PaymentStatus = 'pending' | 'completed' | 'failed' | 'refunded';

// Asset types - matches Liquid Network implementation
type AssetType = 'L-BTC' | 'USDt' | 'any';

// Verification types
type VerificationStatus = 'pending' | 'verified' | 'rejected' | 'expired';
type VerificationType = 'email' | 'phone' | 'identity' | 'skill' | 'address';
```

### API Response Types

```typescript
// Generic API response
interface ApiResponse<T> {
  success: boolean;
  data?: T;
  error?: {
    code: string;
    message: string;
    details?: Record<string, any>;
  };
  meta?: {
    page?: number;
    limit?: number;
    total?: number;
    hasMore?: boolean;
  };
}

// Paginated response
interface PaginatedResponse<T> {
  items: T[];
  pagination: {
    page: number;
    limit: number;
    total: number;
    totalPages: number;
    hasNext: boolean;
    hasPrev: boolean;
  };
}
```

### Validation Schemas

```typescript
// Zod schemas for validation
import { z } from 'zod';

const userSchema = z.object({
  id: z.string().uuid(),
  email: z.string().email(),
  name: z.string().min(1).max(100),
  profilePicture: z.string().url().optional(),
  bio: z.string().max(500).optional(),
  location: z.object({
    address: z.string(),
    coordinates: z.tuple([z.number(), z.number()]),
    radius: z.number().min(0).max(100)
  }).optional(),
  preferences: z.object({
    language: z.string().length(2),
    currency: z.enum(['USD', 'EUR', 'GBP', 'BTC', 'L-BTC', 'USDT']),
    notifications: z.boolean(),
    theme: z.enum(['light', 'dark'])
  }),
  createdAt: z.date(),
  updatedAt: z.date()
});

const taskSchema = z.object({
  id: z.string().uuid(),
  hirerId: z.string().uuid(),
  title: z.string().min(1).max(200),
  description: z.string().min(1).max(2000),
  category: z.string(),
  skills: z.array(z.string()),
  location: z.object({
    type: z.enum(['physical', 'remote']),
    address: z.string().optional(),
    coordinates: z.tuple([z.number(), z.number()]).optional(),
    radius: z.number().min(0).max(100).optional()
  }),
  budget: z.object({
    min: z.number().min(0),
    max: z.number().min(0),
    currency: z.enum(['USD', 'EUR', 'GBP', 'BTC', 'L-BTC', 'USDT']),
    bitcoinAmount: z.number().min(0).optional()
  }),
  timeline: z.object({
    startDate: z.date(),
    endDate: z.date(),
    estimatedHours: z.number().min(0).optional()
  }),
  status: z.enum(['draft', 'open', 'in_progress', 'completed', 'cancelled']),
  createdAt: z.date(),
  updatedAt: z.date()
});
```

## Database Relationships

### Entity Relationships

- User → Tasks (1:many)
- User → Bids (1:many)
- User → Reviews (1:many)
- Task → Bids (1:many)
- Task → Reviews (1:many)
- User → Messages (1:many)
- User → Notifications (1:many)
- User → Schedules (1:many)
- Task → Transactions (1:many)

### Indexes

```sql
-- User indexes
CREATE INDEX idx_user_email ON users(email);
CREATE INDEX idx_user_nostr_key ON users(nostr_public_key);
CREATE INDEX idx_user_location ON users USING GIST(location_coordinates);

-- Task indexes
CREATE INDEX idx_task_hire ON tasks(hirer_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_task_category ON tasks(category);
CREATE INDEX idx_task_status ON tasks(status);
CREATE INDEX idx_task_location ON tasks USING GIST(location_coordinates);
CREATE INDEX idx_task_created ON tasks(created_at);

-- Bid indexes
CREATE INDEX idx_bid_task ON bids(task_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_bid_doer ON bids(doer_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_bid_status ON bids(status);

-- Transaction indexes
CREATE INDEX idx_transaction_from ON transactions(from_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_transaction_to ON transactions(to_user_id);
CREATE INDEX idx_transaction_status ON transactions(status);
CREATE INDEX idx_transaction_hash ON transactions(transaction_hash);
```
